<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom bought back on mkt at NZ$7.12-15.</title>
<headline>Telecom bought back on mkt at NZ$7.12-15.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Monday it bought shares on market during the day's session between NZ$7.12 and $7.15 each in the latest round of its buyback programme.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it bought 105,750 shares. The buyback is set to continue until Telecom advises it has completed the current phase.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64-4 473 4746</p>
</text>
